title: mf gui workspace new
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Create a workspace and print its id

Opens a workspace and prints its id; `--repo` gives it a repository, by default the first the daemon lists ([[Workspaces]]). It is shown in no slot until [[mf gui layout]] puts it in one. Opened by a script the GUI started, it belongs to that script ([[Script sessions]]).
